  ('ent_billie-jean-king', 'person', 'billie-jean-king', 'Billie Jean King', 'published', 'Billie Jean King (née Moffitt; born November 22, 1943) is an American former world No. 1 tennis player. King won 39 Grand Slam titles: 12 in singles, 16 in women''s doubles, and 11 in mixed doubles. She was a member of the victorious United States team in seven Federation Cups and nine Wightman Cups.', '["src_wikidata"]', unixepoch(), 50, 'en');

