  ('ent_laura-bush', 'person', 'laura-bush', 'Laura Bush', 'published', 'Laura Lane Welch Bush (born November 4, 1946) is an American educator who was the first lady of the United States from 2001 to 2009 as the wife of George W. Bush, the 43rd president of the United States. Bush was also the first lady of Texas from 1995 to 2000 when her husband was governor.', '["src_wikidata"]', unixepoch(), 50, 'en');

